@startuml
!include stil.iuml
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam nodesep 55
title Sınıf (class) diyagramı 2: öneriler (Template Method + Registry)

abstract class Commentable
abstract class Hideable {
  + set_hidden(hidden: bool)
}

abstract class BaseProposal <<Template Method>> {
  .. sınıf öznitelikleri (alt sınıf ezer) ..
  + {static} SLUG: str = ''
  + {static} TARGET: str [0..1]
  + {static} LINK: str = ''
  + {static} MORE: bool = False
  + {static} FORM_FIELDS: tuple
  + {static} WEIGHTED: bool = True
  + {static} DUPLICATE_FIELDS: tuple
  + {static} OWNER = 'proposer'
  .. alanlar ..
  + proposer: User [0..1]
  + created_at: datetime
  + voting_ends_at: datetime
  + status: Status = VOTING
  + quorum: int [0..1]
  + applied_at: datetime [0..1]
  + in_discussion: bool = False
  + /deadline: datetime
  + /target: Topic [0..1]
  + /is_open: bool
  + /results_visible: bool
  .. şablon metotlar ..
  + finalize()
  + clean()
  .. kancalar (alt sınıf ezer) ..
  + prefill()
  + check_target()
  # _accepted(t: dict): bool
  + {abstract} apply(): bool
  .. diğer ..
  + save()
  + tally(): dict
  + accepts_votes(): bool
  + is_duplicate(): bool
  + details(): list
  + set_hidden(hidden: bool)
  + {static} targets(): QuerySet
  + {static} offered_for(topic): bool
  + {static} ~_~_init_subclass~_~_()
}

enum Status <<enumeration>> {
  VOTING
  ACCEPTED
  REJECTED
  APPLIED
  FAILED
  CANCELLED
}

class ProposalQuerySet <<Repository>> {
  + running(): QuerySet
  + due(): QuerySet
}

class "voting.models" as Registry <<utility>> {
  + {static} PROPOSALS: dict[str, type]
  + {static} PROPOSAL_MODELS: tuple
  + {static} active_proposals(): list
  + {static} open_proposal_count(user): int
  + {static} required_quorum(): int
  + {static} active_member_count(): int
  + {static} withdraw_running(user)
}

abstract class TopicProposal {
  + {static} TARGET = 'topic'
  + check_target()
}

class TopicOpenProposal {
  + {static} SLUG = 'open'
  + {static} TARGET = 'parent'
  + parent: Topic [0..1]
  + title: str
  + description: str
  + check_target()
  + apply(): bool
}

class TopicEditProposal {
  + {static} SLUG = 'edit'
  + new_title: str
  + new_description: str
  + prefill()
  + apply(): bool
}

class TopicCloseProposal {
  + {static} SLUG = 'close'
  + apply(): bool
}

class TopicDeleteProposal {
  + {static} SLUG = 'delete'
  + apply(): bool
}

class TopicUndoProposal {
  + {static} SLUG = 'undo'
  + action: {REOPEN | RESTORE}
  + {static} targets(): QuerySet
  + prefill()
  + check_target()
  + apply(): bool
}

class RequestProposal {
  + {static} SLUG = 'request'
  + title: str
  + content: str
  + discussion_ends_at: datetime
  + /in_discussion: bool
  + /deadline: datetime
  + save()
  + accepts_votes(): bool
  + apply(): bool
}

class ExpertProposal {
  + {static} SLUG = 'expert'
  + {static} WEIGHTED = False
  + action: {GRANT | REVOKE}
  + reason: str
  + check_target()
  # _accepted(t: dict): bool
  + apply(): bool
}

class Topic {
  + is_closed: bool
  + is_deleted: bool
  + /is_open: bool
  + change(**fields)
}

class User {
  + role: Role
  + /vote_weight: int
  + /can_vote: bool
}

class Vote {
  + choice: Choice
  + weight: int
  + {static} cast(proposal, voter, choice): Vote
}

' Yerleşim ipuçları (görünmez)
Commentable -[hidden]> Hideable
TopicOpenProposal -[hidden]> TopicProposal
TopicProposal -[hidden]> ExpertProposal
TopicEditProposal -[hidden]> TopicCloseProposal
TopicCloseProposal -[hidden]> TopicDeleteProposal
TopicDeleteProposal -[hidden]> TopicUndoProposal
TopicUndoProposal -[hidden]> RequestProposal

' Kalıtım
Commentable <|-- BaseProposal
Hideable <|-- BaseProposal
BaseProposal <|-- TopicOpenProposal
BaseProposal <|-- TopicProposal
BaseProposal <|-- ExpertProposal
TopicProposal <|-- TopicEditProposal
TopicProposal <|-- TopicCloseProposal
TopicProposal <|-- TopicDeleteProposal
TopicProposal <|-- TopicUndoProposal
TopicProposal <|-- RequestProposal

' İlişkiler
BaseProposal +-- Status
ProposalQuerySet <.. BaseProposal : objects
Registry <.. BaseProposal : kaydolur,\nrequired_quorum()
Vote "0..*\nvotes" --* "1\nproposal" BaseProposal
Topic "topic 1" <- "0..*" TopicProposal
ExpertProposal "0..*" -> "1\ntarget_user" User

note left of BaseProposal
  <b>finalize()</b> (şablon metot): süre dolunca
  tally() → required_quorum() → _accepted(t)
  → koşullu UPDATE (bir kez sonuçlanır)
  → apply(); False dönerse FAILED.
  <b>clean()</b>: oy hakkı → açık öneri sınırı
  → check_target() → is_duplicate().
end note

note bottom of Registry
  <b>Registry</b>: SLUG tanımlayan her alt sınıf
  ~_~_init_subclass~_~_() ile PROPOSALS'a kendini
  kaydeder. URL, form, admin, panel ve API bu
  listeyi kullanır: yeni tip = yalnızca alt sınıf.
end note

note bottom of Topic
  change(): kabul edilen önerinin
  apply()'ı çağırır. Command deseni,
  alıcı (receiver) Topic.
end note

legend right
  Gösterim: + public, # korumalı (Python'da _ önekli); //italik// ad soyut sınıf ya da metot;
  __altı çizili__ sınıf düzeyi (sınıf özniteliği, @classmethod); /ad hesaplanan değer (@property);
  ◆ sahiplik (has-a), ▷ kalıtım (is-a), ⊕ iç içe tanım, kesikli ok bağımlılık (uses).
endlegend
@enduml
